# Short, shareable aliases.
#
# NOTE, and this is the trap: `latest` resolves the RELEASE, not the asset name.
# `latest/download/teamree-0.1.0.dmg` therefore keeps pointing at a file called
# teamree-0.1.0.dmg, and 404s the moment v0.2.0 ships. The filename below MUST be
# bumped with every release. `grep -rn '0\.1\.0' site/public` lists every place
# the version appears; the SHA-256 and the "192 MiB" size in index.html need
# changing too and the grep will not find those.
/download/mac  https://github.com/zero-abd/teamree/releases/latest/download/teamree-0.1.0.dmg  302
/download      https://github.com/zero-abd/teamree/releases/latest  302
